<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoBodyText3" align="left" style="margin-right: 45.4pt; text-align: left;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: windowtext;">Hi</span>&nbsp;<span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[</span>&nbsp;</font><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><font color="#181818">&lt;insert contact name&gt; </font><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span></font></span><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font style="">,</font></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 115%;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 115%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">As your <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[</span>&nbsp;<span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><b style="">BT HR Specialist/Client
Liaison <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span></b></span>, I am responsible for ensuring your overall satisfaction
with Insperity’s services. <o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 115%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="line-height: 115%;">While I
understand now may be a busy time, I am hoping that we can find some time to
connect. I would like to gain a better understanding of your current business
operations, as well as any challenges you currently face as an employer. We are
here to support you and we are always available to assist you with your human
resources needs. </span><o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 115%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><span style="line-height: 115%;">I will
contact you periodically to ensure that you are receiving the caliber of
service from Insperity that you expect and to learn if any additional resources
may be of benefit to your company at that time. <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[&nbsp;</span><span style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">I have attached your updated Service
Team Contact Sheet for your records. <span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span></span></span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 115%;"><o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 115%;"><span style="color:red;
background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 115%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Sometimes
the smallest things can make the biggest difference. If there is anything we
can do to make your experience with Insperity more successful, please don't
hesitate to call. <span style="color:#1F497D;mso-themecolor:text2"><o:p></o:p></span></font></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 115%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="line-height: 115%;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We are
committed to ensuring you are completely satisfied with the service provided by
Insperity. <span style="color:#1F497D"><o:p></o:p></span></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoBodyText3" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-right: 45.4pt;"><span style="color: windowtext;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Kind regards,</font><span style="font-size: 14pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class="MsoBodyText3" style="font-family: arial; margin-right: 45.4pt;"><span style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">[</span><font color="#181818">&lt;insert email signature&gt;&nbsp;</font><span style="color: red; font-weight: bold;">]</span></span></p>]]></td>
